Shaakh Se Ek Phool Tutha Tukdhe Tukdhe Hogaya<br>
Dasht Me Qasim Ka Laasha Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
1.Is Jahan Me Jis Ke Dum Jee Rahi Thi Bewa Maa<br>
Wo Zayifi Ka Sahara Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
2.Karbala Me Laasha-e-Qasim Ke Tukhde Dekh Kar<br>
Maa Ka Dil Bhi Aisa Tutha Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
3.Gulbadan Ku Haye Itne Zakhm Khane Ku Mile<br>
Teen Din Ka Bhuka Pyasa Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
4.Karbala Me Zalimou Ne Chakh Kardale Waraq<br>
Bolte Quran Ka Surah Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
5.Aj Bhi Ro Ro Ke Kehte Hai Yeh Mehandi Ke Juloos<br>
Hazrat-e-Qasim Ka Sehra Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
6.Haaye Aada Jism Par Ghudhou Ku Dhoudhate Rahe<br>
Bewa Maa Ka Laal Zinda Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya<br>
<br>
7.Fidwi Itne Tukhdou Me Qasim Ka Laasha Dekh Kar<br>
Umme Farwa Ka Kaleja Tukhde Tukhde Hogaya
